{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Glitchfield\u00a0</strong>is a cooperative horror game for 1\u20134 players. You have to explore this level by yourself or with the help of your friends and complete it, have you ever encountered crashes? and if they have flooded the whole world will you be able to complete the game?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> \u2014 featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812020?t=1759434509","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812020/fdff102a01d5abb44e5b3e63e22e42c82421ee8d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759434509","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812020/aca7357c7044f92e03915d4460fd0ac7bba18b47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759434509","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812020/aca7357c7044f92e03915d4460fd0ac7bba18b47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759434509","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Glitchfield\u00a0</strong>is a cooperative horror game for 1\u20134 players. You have to explore this level by yourself or with the help of your friends and complete it, have you ever encountered crashes? and if they have flooded the whole world will you be able to complete the game?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> \u2014 featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a d